    "headline": "Health Ministry announces medical device regulatory reforms for ease of doing business",
    "body": "The Ministry of Health has introduced new regulations for medical devices. These reforms simplify requirements and enhance transparency for businesses. Outsourced sterilisation rules are now easier for manufacturers to follow. Uniform testing fees and recognized EU jurisdictions reduce ambiguity. These changes facilitate timely access to advanced medical technologies in India.",
