    "headline": "Global Market: China’s property crisis deepens as Evergrande founder gets life sentence",
    "body": "China’s property crisis deepened despite Evergrande founder Hui Ka Yan receiving a life sentence. Falling home prices, unfinished projects, weak sales and developer debt continue to hurt household wealth and consumption. Beijing is shifting support toward technology sectors, but analysts expect the housing market’s prolonged correction to weigh on economic growth for years.",
