    "body": "Donald Trump bought $1–5 million of Berkshire Hathaway shares in June, even as investor Michael Burry questioned the stock’s future after Warren Buffett’s succession. Berkshire has begun deploying its record cash reserves under Greg Abel, buying equities including Alphabet. Strong quarterly profits and revenue growth continue to support investor interest.",
