    "headline": "Xiaomi launches new Xring chip, partners with TSMC for production, sources say",
    "body": "Xiaomi introduced its new Xring O3 smartphone processor, aiming for greater component control. This chip, made by TSMC using its 3nm technology, targets future flagship devices. The company expects to ship between 200,000 and 300,000 units of this new processor. This move aligns with rivals like Apple and Samsung developing their own internal chips. Xiaomi's strategy seeks to reduce reliance on external chip suppliers like Qualcomm.",
