    "headline": "Madhur Knit Crafts, ABH Healthcare SME IPOs Day 1: Early subscription, GMP, and key details",
    "body": "Madhur Knit and ABH Healthcare SME IPOs opened on August 24, 2026, attracting early investor interest. Madhur Knit showed a 16% GMP, while ABH Healthcare had no GMP. Both issues close August 27, with listings expected September 1. Investors will track subscription trends, valuations, proceeds utilisation and grey-market sentiment closely.",
