    "headline": "Smartworks adds Rs 235 crore incremental contracted rental revenue via client expansions across multiple cities",
    "body": "Smartworks has secured Rs 235 crore in new rental revenue from existing clients. This expansion builds upon their substantial Rs 5,400 crore contracted rental revenue base. Large, fully managed campuses allow businesses to expand seamlessly within the same location. This growth reflects a structural shift in India's office market and rising demand. Smartworks' secured footprint positions it strongly to serve clients across its markets.",
