    "headline": "Bank unions threaten nationwide strike on September 11 to press for 5-day banking, other demands",
    "body": "Bank unions will strike nationwide on September 11 due to unresolved demands. This action follows a government 'negative attitude' towards key union proposals. The strike will impact banking services for four days, including holidays. Further strikes are planned for September 28 and an indefinite one from October 26. Unions seek five-day banking, pension improvements, and a uniform incentive scheme.",
