    "headline": "India negotiating FTAs with 8-9 more blocs, aims to cover 75% of global trade: Piyush Goyal",
    "body": "India is actively pursuing free trade agreements with various nations, aiming to cover about 75% percent of the global trade landscape, Trade Minister Piyush Goyal said. With existing arrangements already covering an astounding $70 tn of the global economy, this expansion enhances India’s reputation as a reliable player in international value chains. Moreover, there are significant investment opportunities in cutting-edge fields like data centers and artificial intelligence.",
