    "headline": "JTL Group’s engineering subsidiary announces narrow-width HR coil manufacturing capacity expansion",
    "body": "JTL Engineering Limited will expand its narrow-width HR coil manufacturing capacity. This capital expenditure of Rs 15 crore will double production to 10,000 MT monthly. The expansion will increase the maximum coil width from nine to eleven inches. This enhancement allows the company to meet broader customer product specifications. The new facility is expected to be commissioned in the fourth quarter of fiscal year 2027.",
