    "headline": "Gaja Alternative Asset Management allotment expected today; GMP at 11% — Here’s how to check status online",
    "body": "Gaja Alternative Asset Management IPO allotment is expected today, August 24, after its Rs 550 crore issue was subscribed 31.33 times. QIBs led demand at 43.58 times, while NIIs subscribed 62.35 times. With GMP at Rs 17, or 11%, investors await allotment status before the proposed August 26 listing on NSE and BSE.",
