    "body": "Gold extended its winning streak on MCX, rising for a fourth straight session, while silver snapped a three-day rally as investors tracked the dollar and awaited key US inflation data and Federal Reserve Chair Kevin Warsh’s speech. Analysts expect precious metals to remain volatile, with key support and resistance levels in focus.",
