    "headline": "In favour! FIIs buy 7 multibaggers that soared up to 730% after 2 quarters of selling",
    "body": "After a period of significant sell-offs, foreign investors are making a strategic move by purchasing select Indian stocks demonstrating remarkable performance over the past year. In July alone, FIIs acquired shares worth Rs 11,045 crore, followed by Rs 13,123 crore in August. The notable 730% rise in Cupid's stock highlights this renewed investor confidence, emphasizing a trend towards quality growth companies amid strong sector advantages.",
