    "headline": "Citigroup, Axis Bank team up to leverage NRI deposits as RBI dollar inflows surge",
    "body": "Citigroup and Axis Bank have tied up to finance non-resident Indians investing in foreign-currency deposits, leveraging RBI rules that allow standby letters of credit against such deposits. The arrangement could amplify dollar inflows through offshore financing as India seeks to strengthen foreign-exchange reserves and support the rupee amid strong NRI deposits.",
