    "headline": "Aditya Birla Group taps local lenders for Sprng Energy",
    "body": "Aditya Birla Group is in advanced talks with domestic lenders to raise about Rs 14,000 crore through a long-term loan syndication to fund its acquisition of Shell’s Indian renewable energy platform Sprng Energy. Axis Bank has underwritten the facility, while SBI and HDFC Bank are evaluating commitments for the remaining amount.",
