    "headline": "FSSAI suspends Marche Retail's licence, orders SDP to stop ghee sales",
    "body": "The FSSAI has suspended Marche Retail's license for thirty days due to sanitation and hygiene issues. SDP Industries must stop selling its ghee after laboratory tests detected foreign fats. Inspections revealed multiple deficiencies at Marche Retail's New Delhi facility. These violations included poor record-keeping and inadequate temperature controls for products. The regulator confirmed non-conformity in SDP Industries' ghee after an appeal.",
