    "headline": "Bioinformatics project bags first place in Anveshana, research initiative that won Modi’s praise",
    "body": "Anveshana 2026, a student research initiative, concluded with 20 projects presented by students. Prime Minister Modi highlighted this program in his Mann Ki Baat address. Top projects explored molecular docking, pesticide residues, kitchen waste conversion, and natural latex composites. Experts praised the program for fostering critical thinking and problem-solving skills. This initiative democratizes research access for school students across India.",
