    "headline": "Senco Gold eyes 25 pc revenue growth to Rs 11,000 cr in FY27",
    "body": "This financial year, Senco Gold and Diamonds aims to achieve more than twenty-five percent revenue growth. The company intends to launch approximately twenty new stores by 2026-27, including both franchise and company-owned locations in tier II and III areas. By enhancing their presence in eastern and northern regions, Senco is making significant strides, although their overseas expansion efforts in Dubai are facing delays due to regional instability.",
