    "headline": "India-Japan business mission to focus on semiconductors, electronics; MoUs expected during visit: FICCI",
    "body": "India and Japan will enhance cooperation in semiconductors and electronics. Memorandum of Understandings are expected during the ongoing business mission. A large delegation is visiting Japan to strengthen bilateral business relations. Discussions will focus on deepening engagement and addressing business priorities. This initiative reflects the ambition of both nations' strategic partnership.",
