    "headline": "FSSAI suspends license of Marche Retail; restrains SDP Industries from selling ghee",
    "body": "The FSSAI has suspended Marche Retail's license for significant food safety violations. SDP Industries is now prohibited from selling all ghee variants due to adulteration concerns. The regulator also issued over 150 notices to major food companies recently. These notices addressed misleading advertisements and labeling non-compliances by prominent brands.",
